5,1,1,talk,Shion,,We need a logical way to decide this. Let's look at the facts before we start arguing.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. It would be better to see the actual costs and usage first.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know who is actually using it! It's like a mystery game!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience, my friends. Let us seek the truth of our habits and the space we share.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. We should examine the efficiency of the current setup and where the time is being spent.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, your enthusiasm is noted, but let's focus on the environment. The noise and the mess are the real issues.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Um, maybe we should check the invoices too? Just to be sure about the budget.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, but the mystery is the best part! I bet we'll find something super surprising!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,A room is more than its walls; it is the spirit of the people within it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Spirit is fine, but labor is tangible. I want to see the actual numbers on the maintenance.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
