35,2,1,talk,Shion,,It seems my suspicions were correct. The current arrangement is far from ideal for privacy or hygiene.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I saw the quotes. The costs are actually quite high. We're spending a lot on outside hire too.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,I found it! Only two people are using it all the time! And there are crumbs everywhere!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a tragedy of proximity. We sit side by side, yet we are islands in a vast sea.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The outside hire is a waste of money, and the facilities logs show we are ignoring the simplest spaces.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, if the costs are high, then a complete refit is illogical. We need a functional compromise.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm just worried... if we pick something expensive, who has to sign for it? We're already paying monthly.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,Why are only two people using it? That's not fair! Everyone should get a turn to play or relax!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Servas,,"We have forgotten how to speak the difficult truths. We need a sanctuary for the heart, not just a room.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,We are losing hours to inefficiency. The outside hire is a symptom of a room that fails its purpose.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Servas, a ""sanctuary"" doesn't stop the noise from leaking into the office. We need soundproofing or a change in use.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,Maybe... maybe we can find a way that doesn't cost as much as the quotes?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"I think we should make a rule! No more ""first come, first served""! That's why it's a mess!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Servas,,"A wall can block sound, but it can also block a hand reached out in kindness.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The data suggests we are paying for space we don't use and ignoring the labor of upkeep.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shion,,Let's be realistic. We can't have a room that is everything to everyone. It's time to choose one primary function.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope we can decide something that doesn't put too much pressure on anyone.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,I want it to be a place where we all have to help clean up together!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us choose the path that brings us closer, rather than the one that merely organizes our furniture.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I will support any option that minimizes wasted hours and unnecessary external costs.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
